# Direct dependencies of the training environment; requirements.txt is compiled from this file
# (see README.md). torch 2.14.0 from PyPI is the CUDA 13.0 build, which the driver (CUDA 13.2)
# runs; transformers is pinned to the serving environment's release so that chat templates render
# identically in training and in serving. flash-linear-attention provides the Triton kernels of
# the Gated DeltaNet layers, which transformers otherwise runs in slow reference PyTorch.
